// What the sun grows, and the first thing a *stopped* tower can make.
//
// The counterweight to bamboo. Deep shade is biomass-rich and sun-poor,
// which since M1 has meant a sun-seeking route buys charge and nothing
// else — a means rather than an end, so the open branches read as a
// sacrifice with a rebate. Resin feedstock is the end: it grows in the light,
// it becomes the resonator drums an array spins and the insulation around
// charge cells, and it accrues per tick
// rather than per pace, so it is the one harvest a berthed tower does
// not give up (`SYSTEMS.md` §5.2).
#![enable(implicit_some)]
ItemDef(
    id: "item.resin_feedstock",
    name: "Resin feedstock",
    glyph: "◉",
    order: 14,
)
